#: MainFrame.cpp:272
msgid ""
"What the preview shows: the decoded HAM6 result, a map of the HAM operation "
"used for each pixel (black = Select, red/green/blue = Modify R/G/B), an "
"error map (brightness = distance from the source image, white = 0.10 OKLab "
"or more), or the original: the picture as the encoder received it (cropped, "
"scaled, color-corrected), at the size of the preview - the \"before\" to the "
"HAM6 \"after\", in the same place at the same zoom. F6 cycles through the "
"views, F7 switches between the original and what was shown before. The error "
"map and the original are only available for the single-frame preview, not "
"while an animation plays."
msgstr ""

