#: MainFrame.cpp:352
msgid ""
"After a conversion: error = mean OKLab distance per pixel (lower is better); "
"blurred = the same after blurring both pictures a little (sigma 1.5 px), the "
"way eye and monitor mix neighboring pixels - this one rewards dithering; "
"SSIM = structural similarity of the lightness, 1 = identical (it sees dither "
"noise as foreign structure, so dithering lowers it). The three do not add up "
"to one score: compare conversions by the figure that matters for your "
"picture."
msgstr ""

