#: ParameterPanel.cpp:471
msgid "Chroma <-> Luminance: 1.00"
msgstr ""

#: ParameterPanel.cpp:482
msgid "Allow Modify at line start"
msgstr ""

#: ParameterPanel.cpp:484
msgid ""
"Lets a scanline start with a Modify of the border color (palette color 0), "
"as the ILBM specification allows. Slightly better quality at the left edge, "
"but decoders that start every line from black (e.g. netpbm's ilbmtoppm) show "
"those pixels wrongly. No difference if color 0 is black."
msgstr ""

#: ParameterPanel.cpp:492
msgid "Lookahead: off"
msgstr ""

#: ParameterPanel.cpp:493
#, c-format
msgid "Lookahead: %d pixels"
msgstr ""

#: ParameterPanel.cpp:496
msgid ""
"Looks several pixels ahead when choosing each HAM operation, so that a color "
"change can start before an edge instead of after it. Less smearing at edges "
"(error about 3 to 6 percent lower), but the conversion takes roughly 3 to 10 "
"times longer; 3 pixels is a good compromise. Off by default, as it makes "
"every preview slower. Animations take proportionally longer, too."
msgstr ""

